<title>AUSTRALIA: CBA board member Kennedy retires.</title>
<headline>CBA board member Kennedy retires.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commonwealth Bank of Australia (CBA) board member Jim Kennedy will retire at the end of the month, the bank said on Friday.</p>
<p>Kennedy spent 23 years as a board member and is retiring to pursue other interests, chairman Tim Besley said in a statement.</p>
<p>Kennedy's retirement is effective June 30.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
